---
import { withBase } from '../../../utils/url';
---

<div class="s-content-slider" data-plr-component="s-content-slider">
  <div class="u-container">
    <div
      class="b-slider-content b-slider-content--style-3"
      data-lg-reveal
      data-plr-component="b-slider-content"
    >
      <div class="b__slides js-slides">
        <div class="b__shapes">
          <div class="b__shape"></div>
          <div class="b__shape"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="a-waves a-waves--blue" data-plr-component="a-waves"></div>
        <div class="a-strips" data-plr-component="a-strips"></div>
        <div
          class="b__slide sb-slide sb-slide--text is-active js-slide"
          data-slide="0"
        >
          <div class="sb__inner">
            <div class="sb__content">
              <h2 class="sb__title t-h-4xs">
                <span class="a-bullet-point"></span>

                Hierarki dan Lingkup Akses
              </h2>
              <div class="sb__text t-t-sm">
                Pimpinan melihat unit yang dipimpinnya beserta seluruh
                turunannya, tidak lebih. Otorisasi ditentukan oleh unit objek
                yang dinilai, bukan unit asal penilai.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="b__loader">
              <div class="b__loader__shape"></div>
              <div class="b__loader__shape"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="sb__image">
            <picture
              class="lazy-image__img b-image"
              data-lg-parallax="child"
              data-lg-parallax-amplitude="-1"
              data-plr-component="b-image"
            >
              <img
                alt=""
                decoding="async"
                height="518"
                loading="lazy"
                src={withBase("/assets/images/step-hierarchy.svg")}
                width="480"
              />
            </picture>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="b__slide sb-slide sb-slide--text js-slide" data-slide="1">
          <div class="sb__inner">
            <div class="sb__content">
              <h2 class="sb__title t-h-4xs">
                <span class="a-bullet-point"></span>

                Penugasan yang Dapat Diaudit
              </h2>
              <div class="sb__text t-t-sm">
                Setiap batch penugasan menyimpan aturan, daftar calon, jejak
                pemilihan, dan pembuatnya. Hasil pengacakan dapat ditelusuri
                ulang bila ada pertanyaan di kemudian hari.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="sb__image">
            <picture
              class="lazy-image__img b-image"
              data-lg-parallax="child"
              data-lg-parallax-amplitude="-1"
              data-plr-component="b-image"
            >
              <img
                alt=""
                decoding="async"
                height="518"
                loading="lazy"
                src={withBase("/assets/images/step-audit.svg")}
                width="480"
              />
            </picture>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="b__slide sb-slide sb-slide--text js-slide" data-slide="2">
          <div class="sb__inner">
            <div class="sb__content">
              <h2 class="sb__title t-h-4xs">
                <span class="a-bullet-point"></span>

                Formulir yang Wajib Lengkap
              </h2>
              <div class="sb__text t-t-sm">
                Seluruh parameter wajib terisi sebelum jawaban dapat dikirim.
                Draf boleh disimpan sebagian dan dilanjutkan kapan saja, tetapi
                draf tidak pernah ikut dihitung. Sistem selalu memeriksa ulang
                setiap jawaban sebelum diterima.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="sb__image">
            <picture
              class="lazy-image__img b-image"
              data-lg-parallax="child"
              data-lg-parallax-amplitude="-1"
              data-plr-component="b-image"
            >
              <img
                alt=""
                decoding="async"
                height="518"
                loading="lazy"
                src={withBase("/assets/images/step-form.svg")}
                width="480"
              />
            </picture>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="b__slide sb-slide sb-slide--text js-slide" data-slide="3">
          <div class="sb__inner">
            <div class="sb__content">
              <h2 class="sb__title t-h-4xs">
                <span class="a-bullet-point"></span>

                Perhitungan yang Transparan
              </h2>
              <div class="sb__text t-t-sm">
                Rincian hasil bisa dibuka untuk melihat bagaimana nilai akhir
                terbentuk, lengkap dengan siapa saja yang menilai.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="sb__image">
            <picture
              class="lazy-image__img b-image"
              data-lg-parallax="child"
              data-lg-parallax-amplitude="-1"
              data-plr-component="b-image"
            >
              <img
                alt=""
                decoding="async"
                height="518"
                loading="lazy"
                src={withBase("/assets/images/step-chart.svg")}
                width="480"
              />
            </picture>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="b__slide sb-slide sb-slide--text js-slide" data-slide="4">
          <div class="sb__inner">
            <div class="sb__content">
              <h2 class="sb__title t-h-4xs">
                <span class="a-bullet-point"></span>

                Finalisasi dan Revisi
              </h2>
              <div class="sb__text t-t-sm">
                Setiap hasil final tersimpan lengkap dengan detail
                perhitungannya. Kalau ada revisi setelahnya, hasil final yang
                lama tetap bisa dilihat dan tidak berubah.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="sb__image">
            <picture
              class="lazy-image__img b-image"
              data-lg-parallax="child"
              data-lg-parallax-amplitude="-1"
              data-plr-component="b-image"
            >
              <img
                alt=""
                decoding="async"
                height="518"
                loading="lazy"
                src={withBase("/assets/images/step-archive.svg")}
                width="480"
              />
            </picture>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="b__pagination">
        <ul class="b__pages">
          <li class="b__page">
            <button class="b__page__button is-active js-page" data-page="0">
              1
            </button>
          </li>
          <li class="b__page">
            <button class="b__page__button js-page" data-page="1"> 2 </button>
          </li>
          <li class="b__page">
            <button class="b__page__button js-page" data-page="2"> 3 </button>
          </li>
          <li class="b__page">
            <button class="b__page__button js-page" data-page="3"> 4 </button>
          </li>
          <li class="b__page">
            <button class="b__page__button js-page" data-page="4"> 5 </button>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
